        "id": 1165609
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-03T09:29:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that it feels intrusive, but I don\u0027t understand the proposed alternative?\nAre you saying to kick off sampling on the first call to the function? in that case, we\u0027d have to check for count \u003d\u003d 0 or not in the console function and based on that kick it off? or is the suggestion something else?",
